  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Garfield, New Jersey · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>A wedding at<br><em>The Venetian</em></h1><p class=\"gv-couple\">Stephanie &amp; Danny</p><p class=\"gv-lede\">A kiss on the grand staircase. A first dance beneath the chandeliers. Stephanie and Danny’s wedding brings the scale of The Venetian together with moments that belong to the two of them.</p></header><section class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Stephanie and Danny’s wedding film\"><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/683\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny on The Venetian grand staircase\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"331322129\" data-film-title=\"Stephanie &amp; Danny at The Venetian\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Stephanie &amp; Danny at The Venetian\"><span>Watch their wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Stephanie &amp; Danny · A wedding film by GioLina Films</p><p class=\"gv-watch-link\"><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/331322129\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch on Vimeo</a></p></section><section class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">From the staircase to the first dance.</h2><p>The ornate railings and warm light frame their staircase portrait. Outside, an evening portrait offers a quieter view of the couple. Back in the ballroom, the entrance and first dance bring everyone into the celebration.</p><p>These photographs and the film offer two ways to revisit the same wedding: a closer look at a moment, and the movement that carries it forward.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Four photographs from Stephanie and Danny’s wedding\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny sharing a kiss on The Venetian staircase beneath a chandelier\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-venetian-staircase.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) 45vw, 520px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny sharing a kiss on The Venetian staircase beneath a chandelier\"></a><figcaption>A portrait on the grand staircase.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny together on an evening terrace\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-evening-portrait.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) 45vw, 520px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny together on an evening terrace\"></a><figcaption>A few moments together outside.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-entrance.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny celebrating their entrance beneath ballroom chandeliers\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-entrance-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-entrance-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-entrance.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) 45vw, 520px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny celebrating their entrance beneath ballroom chandeliers\"></a><figcaption>The reception begins.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Stephanie and Danny sharing their first dance\"><img src=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance-small.webp 640w, /assets/stephanie-danny-first-dance.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) 45vw, 520px\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Stephanie and Danny sharing their first dance\"></a><figcaption>Their first dance.</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Bergen County</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">The Venetian, Garfield</h2></div><div><p>The Venetian is a wedding and event venue on River Drive in Garfield, New Jersey. The staircase and chandelier lit reception spaces are part of the setting in Stephanie and Danny’s photographs.</p><p>When planning portraits, talk with your venue and photography team about access to the spaces you want to use and how that time fits around your reception.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://www.venetiannj.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit The Venetian’s website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Your wedding</p><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Tell us what you’re planning.</h2><p>Getting married at The Venetian? Share your date and what matters most to you. We’ll talk through photography and film coverage for your day.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Another North Jersey wedding</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/the-park-savoy-florham-park/\">Deanna &amp; Anthony at The Park Savoy</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script>"
